Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||12-29-2000||03:18 AM||||My moms car has a 3.8L V6, it spins the tires with very little effort, even on dry pavement..<P>Only smoked them a couple of times though, once was when the tires were spinning on ice (speedo said 90kph, I wasn't moving) and when it melted through the ice, I got a loud squeal, some nice smelling smoke (lol) and the car practically jumped... hehehe..<P>the other time.. well.. let's just say I didn't have all 4 wheels on the ground. in fact 2 were in a ditch, one was just touching the road, and the 4th was up in the air... ah, fun times. LOL!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
